<title>NETHERLANDS: WOLTERS KLUWER ACQUIRES NILS PUBLISHERS.</title>
<headline>WOLTERS KLUWER ACQUIRES NILS PUBLISHERS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch publisher Wolters Kluwer NV said on Wednesday it had acquired the NILS publishing company in Chatsworth, California from ABC Inc, a subsidiary of the Walt Disney company.</p>
</text>
